Move the view-local composing marker from InlineStyle onto LayoutRun, the
view-only run type, so it is not type-reachable from any model, clipboard,
clone, or DOCX/PDF export path — leak-proof by construction rather than by
convention. injectComposingInline returns the injected inline's index and
layoutBlock tags the resulting runs; composingStyleFrom is unchanged and
renderRun reads run.composing.

Also expand the test plan per review: assert the composing underline paints
a 1px solid stroke in the resolved text color, and that commit / abort / blur
clear the run so no further underline is drawn once the composing context is
gone.
